order:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;data-access&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Application Server (bus), retrieval, ingestion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Repositories + lưu tệp; RLS theo quyền&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ISql&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;data-access&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;SQL, vector HNSW, toàn văn GIN, hàng đợi job&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;IObjectStore&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Object Storage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;data-access&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;API tương thích S3; mã hóa phía máy chủ&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;IRetriever&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;retrieval (HybridRetriever)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;answering&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;findRelevant(question, scope, topK)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:4px 8px